{
  "id": "2SA.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samweli 19",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoabu goowoowsa Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geeyeesha Yoabu, “Ng'ula, sugoocheanda gooyeawda nea gagiisan aba badayda Absalomu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwayamwa jooriischooda nyaawa aba ng'ucheeda ghoah giiseaneega aba heeda buuneesean; aba gideaba ghwayiiy buuneesean eaweedida gideaba, “Sugoocheanda gagiisan aba badayda orjeedaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghafuy geat buuneeda eaweedida ak gaweay jeeda mujiini gawuurji fuga bwaspwas fuy geat damanda mang'aw aba ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwadukuta sugoocheanda gheanyangaaschi, ak gooyeawda sugoocheanda nea goojuur, “Ea orjeedeanyu Absalomu, Ea Absalomu, orjeedeanyu, orjeedeanyu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaan Yoabu jeeda gheeda heeda sugoocheanda, ak gwayeesha, “Eanean nibwaspwas gheanyanga fugaagu sean bea gadiyeeda, gwachi aghu gurooroadaang'u askweareani, ea eaweega orjoagaagu ea haweagaagu, ea eaweega gadeemgaagu ea gwealajeagaagu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba gibwariinyi fugiga sinyiin nea gisti fugiga bwariinyiin. Aba gideaba nidaajiidi askweareani gideaba shirikareeda hees ea fuga gadiyeeda mii gili aba headaang'u, aba gideaba askweareani neajeeng'u gideaba gwachi Absalomu iimajeek gwachi gajeemeewa eesa sean askweareani, ak gwachi gayghwadoabiiw aba headaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'eada ghamneawa, ak giriti abaloola fugaagu bea gadiyeeda nea giijiileesi; aba gideaba aniini ghaayaaji habeawooda aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba iimuwani, ea manda siida jea mideawana eaweani; ak gaygamunyiit ng'asheanji aba headaang'u ea ghwanaawa ng'asheega sean munyas ghayi ninyasi ghang'eada hisiindaang'u bea heeda ea ghoah ghamneawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat sugoocheanda, ak goopteada aba dooshta. Ak geerukusa buuneesean gideaba, “Ang'ula, sugoocheanda goopteada aba dooshta”; ng'ata ghapka buuneesean madeeda sugoocheanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi gwareapshi aba biikteayda Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida fuga Israeli niba siisi mang'awsa gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghwajal buuneesean bea dooshinga Israeli, nea gwayi, “Sugoocheanda gooruunaneasa geatinga weajoodigaasa, ak gwalealnaneasa geatinga fuga Filisti; ak ghamneawa ea nimng'aw aba jeeda ng'eanyiida aba madeeda Absalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Absalomuheeda ghayi simwaarji goombaleasa, ea nimeewsa ng'ucheeda. Asi ghamneawa ghwasaan inyas mirukuni gil aba giideelnooda sugoocheanda?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanung' sugoocheanda was Dawdi gawa iita heeda Sadoki ea Abiyatari was ashoohoodiga nea gwayeesha, “Eeshiina gweargwa Yuda, ‘Ghwasaan inyas agooga gajahuuwa fuga huuydean aba giideelnooda sugoocheanda ghwaan gheanyi, nea nihidu ng'asheanda Israeleesean heeda sugoocheanda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga goowooschi buweadeegeasu, goowooschi geakeasu ea foojeandeanyu; abeeda ghwasaan inyas gajahuuwa fuga huuydean aba giideelnooda sugoocheanda?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha Amasa, ‘Ang'iing'i muwoosi geapkeedeanyu ea saseedeanyu? ASEETA sinnean ng'asheanji, ea suuk gaasaang'a, iimuwoosi ghamneawa shirikarajeanda haw bea lugoodeanyu aba hoorgeeda Yoabu.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwasat ng'asheagaaschi gurooruunatka fuga sean gaweesa ng'asheanda ak ghwanung' gawuurji siyagi; ak ghwanung' gaweesa ng'asheanda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha, “Biikni ang'iing'i sea fugaagu sean bea gadiyeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiigu sugoocheanda Yordani; ak ghwahidu Yuda Gilgali gwaroonyi sugoocheanda ak gweadu sugoocheanda googeawna Yordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamwach geaw Shimeyi was orjeeda Gera, bea dooshta Benjamini, leabu ng'eanyiida Bahurimu, ak ghwararang'aan sea fuga Yuda gwaroonyi sugoocheanda was Dawdi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea goodeana fih sagalama bea eemeeda Benjamini. Ak ghwahidu eara Siba was siida gadiyeeda fuga gheeh Sawli, nea gwandeawa orju damanamuut ikaaschi sea fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda diktam, ak gwasalda gaweay Yordani goosheedeawa sugoocheanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoaghaawa ghealooda ak gweadu fuga gheeda sugoocheanda, ak gwasin gidagasa sugoocheanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi goohiimsa Shimeyi baydeayda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoabeada Shimei was orjeeda Gera aba madeeda sugoocheanda, damanda riikghta ghoaghaawa Yordani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayeesha niny sugoocheanda, “Gidabal ea mwanung' ng'utamiideanyu doaw siida mideawa giidiinyeanda ghana ghoapkaat gida adiiyda siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda aba eaweeda beawa ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda aba Yerusalemu; gagasa ea mwayiina sugoocheanda uhuudaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda ghwanal gideaba nisin riing'eeda; asi, ng'ula, aniini naawunyi askweareani, was duweacheedeaba sean bea gheeh Yosefu ghaawunyi daroonyi ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasha Abishayi was orjeeda Seruya ak gwayeesha, “Neada Shimeyi ea majeenuus aba ng'asheanji, aba gideaba ghamwaashta NG'UTAMIIDA simwaari?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha, “Aniini gaydasimaneey naaha, agooga orjooga Seruya, bwak ea ahuwa weajoodigeasu askweareani? Neada gwanda siida wassean jea eenuus askweareani aba Israeli? Aba gideaba askweareani aniini neada ea mwaanali gideaba geawooschi sugoocheanda Israeli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha sugoocheanda Shimeyi, “Ang'iing'i maymeawa.” Ak gweaksa sugoocheanda habeawooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi ghabwayda Mefibosheti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghwahidu Mefibosheti was orjeeda Sawli gwaroonyi sugoocheanda; nea miigoohuun geeshangaaschi, nea mii ghwareakghu deamuukaaschi, ghana goohuun hang'weakaaschi, ghang'eada damanda ghayi beawa sugoocheanda ea ghwahita eaweeda biikna sugoocheanda nea gaba seayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean damanda wuna Yerusalemu gwaroonyi sugoocheanda, ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha niny, “Ghwasaan ang'iing'i inyas meeteayeeni sea aniini, Mefibosheti?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiideanyu, Ea sugoocheanda, gwareenganean siideanyu bea gadiyeeda; aba gideaba gwayeesha siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda niny, ‘Gooynean digeeda, ak geading'di ak geeteayi sea sugoocheanda.’ Aba gideaba siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda gaba bada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niny nibeash siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda aba heeda ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda. Iidu ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda gawuurji malaykajeanda ASEETA, asi sina gididaahi gideaba aamiy aba headaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fuga ghaheanya sean gawuurji fuga meewa aba madeeda ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda; amadu giyiin siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda jeeda fuga agiischi aba badayda measeadaang'u. Abeeda ghwadoabiiwiini aba heedeanyu, jea ghwanung' deayeawusa sugoocheanda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha niny, “Ghwasaan inyas gudu rukuni ng'asheega badaydaang'u? Gaydasin aniini: ang'iing'i ea Siba gajalacha ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Mefibosheti sugoocheanda, “Ghwahit, nung'waada gageanda niny sean, iinukwa nibiigu ghoah ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda nea gaba seayu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi goohiimsa Barsilayi baydeayda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gudugwahidu Barsilayi bea eemeeda Gileyadi nea gwaleabu Rogelimu; ak goodeayi sea sugoocheanda ea ghwahita Yordani, ak ghoadoabiiw ghwanung' ghoaghaawa Yordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Barsilayi niwaasiit muuchi, nea gaba gweanyeew seedam; nea abeeda ea niidaw sugoocheanda hamita aba damanda mideewa Mahanaimu; aba gideaba niny siida baruur muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha Barsilayi, “Beeni eakghaawa sea aniini, ak gaydaarearnyi aba Yerusalemu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Barsilayi ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Neada askwearjoojiga eaweegeasu ea gudughwashoada suh deanaan, bwak ea deadeayi sugoocheanda Yerusalemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini ghamneawa geabeayi gweanyeew seedam; gaydaamu deaheeli gidamiy ea gidamuyi? Neada siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda ghoamu gwasamu gidak ghana gidaleahi? Gaydaamu dealeeysiit ghuusiga headiga sarman ea dea gadeemga sarmani? Abeeda ghwasaan inyas gayghoahaat siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda sareenda ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda gagasa ghoaghaawa gilimwanang' Yordani sea sugoocheanda. Abeeda ghwasaan inyas gaygagoonan sugoocheanda gidahaw deenu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geamuscheey nung' gabiikta siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda, ak abeeda geameewsi jeeda mujiineedeanyu, murdeeda bung'eeda bwaabwa ea iyya. Ak ea nukwa siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda was Gihamu; nung'waada ghoaghaaw sea ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda; ak gisisi niny gididaahi ang'iing'i gideaba ghwahit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwasha sugoocheanda nea gwayeesha, “Gaydaaghaaw aniini sea Gihamu, ak gaydasissa niny gida wassean aadaayi gideaba ghwahit aba headaang'u; ea haleanjeeda sean igasayi aba heedeanyu gaydasineey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoaghaawa buuneesean Yordani, ak ghoaghaaw sugoocheanda; ak ghwasam sugoocheanda gheata Barsilayi ak ghoadaw ghawooda, ak ghwayam geaw gabiikta ghoah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yuda ea Israeli gwajalsa badayda sugoocheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghang'ata sugoocheanda gawa Gilgali, hean goodeayi Gihamu sea niny; nea ghoadoabiiw buuneesean bea Yuda, ak eara hamarjeemba fuga Israeli, ghoaghaaw sea sugoocheanda ak goodeayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghapka buuneesean bea Israeli heeda sugoocheanda, ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Ghwasaan buweadeagaasa was fuga Yuda inyas gwajagwanyi, ak ghwaat sugoocheanda sea fugeaba gheanyi ak ghoaghaawa Yordani, sea buuneesean bea Dawdi sea niny?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwasha buuneesean bea Yuda ghuusiga fuga Israeli nea gwayeesha, “Gweagu gideaba sugoocheanda ea neekeewa buweadeagaasa. Abeeda ghwasaan inyas ghoanyareaschi aba badaydeaba ng'asheanji? Neada aseasa ea siyaaji gida wassean bea sugoocheanda? Ghana nigooneasa gida wassean?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda fuga Israeli ak gwayeesha fuga Yuda, “Aseasa geendeawi ng'asheega sigasayi niba damanamughuush aba heeda sugoocheanda, ak eara aba heeda Dawdi geeburdeaweegwa agooga. Abeeda ghwasaan inyas goofooleasa? Neada ea meewoosi fuga madeeda rugu giideelnooda sugoocheandeanya?” Ak gang'weaniidi ng'asheega fuga Yuda ea ghwanaawa gea fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
